					<h2><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Gwen Nur Karima Jenkins">Gwen Nur Karima Jenkins</a></h2>
					<!-- p class="post-info">Sep 5th, 2013 by <a href="http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?author=3" title="Posts by khushi" rel="author">khushi</a> </p -->
					<p class="post-meta"><ul class='post-meta'>
</ul>
</p>
