				<div class="entry">
					<p>Birth date: September 9, 1947   URS date: September 4, 2013</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="wp-content/uploads/2013/09/IMG_1733.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-1072" alt="IMG_1733" src="wp-content/uploads/2013/09/IMG_1733-300x225.jpg" width="300" height="225" /></a><a href="wp-content/uploads/2013/09/IMG_0145_2.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-1073" alt="IMG_0145_2" src="wp-content/uploads/2013/09/IMG_0145_2-201x300.jpg" width="201" height="300" /></a><a href="wp-content/uploads/2013/09/IMG_3787.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-1074" alt="IMG_3787" src="wp-content/uploads/2013/09/IMG_3787-187x300.jpg" width="187" height="300" /></a>Gwen Nur Karima Jenkins, left the physical world on Wednesday, September 4, 2013. She had been surrounded by a plethora of  loving friends since her second cancer diagnosis in October, 2012.  Gwen didn&#8217;t care about her life story which spanned her almost 66 years of life; what was most important to her were her friendships, and she was blessed with many Beloveds who loved her deeply.  A no nonsense, straight shooter with a dry sense of humor,  a lover of  the natural world, and of beauty, Gwen was very much with us until 3 days before her passing.  She is deeply missed by her circle.</p>
<p>If anyone feels so moved, a donation can be made in Gwen&#8217;s name to Hospice of Petaluma, 416 Payran St., Petaluma 94952.</p>
	
				       				
																					
				</div>
		
				<p class="postmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comments" title="Comment on Gwen Nur Karima Jenkins">9 Comments &#187;</a></p>
				
<!-- You can start editing here. -->

	<h3 id="comments">9 Memories for &#8220;Gwen Nur Karima Jenkins&#8221;</h3> 

	<ol class="commentlist">
						<li class="alt" id="comment-15715">
			<div class="cmtinfo"><em> on 05 Sep 2013 at 6:47 pm</em><small class="commentmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comment-15715" title=""><span class="commentnum">1</span></a></small><cite>ShaBaz</cite></div>
						
			<p>Gwen, sister on so many of the same paths,<br />
you will always be in my heart.</p>
			
		</li>

	
					<li class="" id="comment-15717">
			<div class="cmtinfo"><em> on 05 Sep 2013 at 7:19 pm</em><small class="commentmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comment-15717" title=""><span class="commentnum">2</span></a></small><cite>Sa'adia</cite></div>
						
			<p>Gwen Nur Karima, my Soul Sister on the Spiritual Guidance journey, your infectious smile and heartfelt laughter resonate within me now&#8230;I am blessed to have you as a Heartmate in Life with the One.  I know you are Loving and Light-filled and filling the skies with your big Bright smiles ! Thanks for your continued presence in Love </p>
			
		</li>

	
					<li class="alt" id="comment-15720">
			<div class="cmtinfo"><em> on 05 Sep 2013 at 8:25 pm</em><small class="commentmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comment-15720" title=""><span class="commentnum">3</span></a></small><cite>Mirabai Joan Kolari</cite></div>
						
			<p>I can still hear your comment&#8230;..  &#8220;His name is Blue Sky?  At our age?  That can&#8217;t be good!&#8221;  Oh how we laughed.  Thank you for all that you have shared with me.  I will miss you Dear Friend.</p>
			
		</li>

	
					<li class="" id="comment-15722">
			<div class="cmtinfo"><em> on 06 Sep 2013 at 3:33 am</em><small class="commentmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comment-15722" title=""><span class="commentnum">4</span></a></small><cite>Mary Shaffea</cite></div>
						
			<p>Dear Gwen Nur Karima,<br />
We met in silence each week and never spoke. Your elegance and courage  was an inspiration to me. Blessings.<br />
Mary Shaffea</p>
			
		</li>

	
					<li class="alt" id="comment-15728">
			<div class="cmtinfo"><em> on 06 Sep 2013 at 11:43 am</em><small class="commentmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comment-15728" title=""><span class="commentnum">5</span></a></small><cite>Noor Amina</cite></div>
						
			<p>I am remembering you in light</p>
			
		</li>

	
					<li class="" id="comment-15730">
			<div class="cmtinfo"><em> on 06 Sep 2013 at 1:47 pm</em><small class="commentmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comment-15730" title=""><span class="commentnum">6</span></a></small><cite>marlowe</cite></div>
						
			<p>Beloved Gwen,<br />
The reports you posted of your walks at the wildlife area, with wonderful photos of the swans and flora and fauna, sharing your love and appreciation of beauty, were touching to me. I will miss your steady, calm presence. Travel well,<br />
Marlowe</p>
			
		</li>

	
					<li class="alt" id="comment-15731">
			<div class="cmtinfo"><em> on 06 Sep 2013 at 5:26 pm</em><small class="commentmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comment-15731" title=""><span class="commentnum">7</span></a></small><cite>Daisy and Peter</cite></div>
						
			<p>What a loss for all of us who loved you.  May you carry with you blessings like the ones you leave behind.</p>
			
		</li>

	
					<li class="" id="comment-15732">
			<div class="cmtinfo"><em> on 06 Sep 2013 at 6:27 pm</em><small class="commentmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comment-15732" title=""><span class="commentnum">8</span></a></small><cite>Lakshmi Bhaktirose</cite></div>
						
			<p>Gwen, </p>
<p>You are a true inspiration on my life&#8217;s path.  Thank you for shining so bright and  much peace and comfort on your journey.</p>
			
		</li>

	
					<li class="alt" id="comment-30472">
			<div class="cmtinfo"><em> on 10 Aug 2014 at 3:40 pm</em><small class="commentmetadata"><a href="index.html%3Fp=1070#comment-30472" title=""><span class="commentnum">9</span></a></small><cite>Zahira</cite></div>
						
			<p>We have the funds for Gwenkins&#8217; memorial bench, thanks to the amazing generosity of our many friends. It will be such a comfort to hike up to Gwen&#8217;s bench in the woods and commune with her bubbly spirit in her native habitat. Thank you Beloved for the communion of those most dear to us who, having finished their earthly course, have returned home. May they continue to be an inspiration to us.<br />
Gwen, your memory still lights up my heart and your wonderful humor still fills me with joy and I must admit to missing your physical presence so deeply. May your soul be eternally blessed, dear One.</p>
			
		</li>

	
	
	</ol>

